# Deterministic line endings. The jar-parity gate diffs every resource byte-for-byte, so a
# fresh checkout must not depend on the committer's core.autocrlf: a CRLF worktree leaks CRLF
# into the built jar via processResources' verbatim copies (the S0 gate caught exactly that).
* text=auto
*.java text eol=lf
*.gradle text eol=lf
*.properties text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.json5 text eol=lf
*.mcmeta text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.obj text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
src/generated/**/.cache/cache text eol=lf
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.nbt binary
